1
00:00:00,246 --> 00:00:04,586
- Why?
- So we can communicate through the wall.

2
00:00:05,167 --> 00:00:08,087
(Leonard:)We are communicating through the wall.

3
00:00:08,254 --> 00:00:11,594
(Sheldon:)Yes, but the communication
is not encrypted.

4
00:00:12,091 --> 00:00:15,221
- I don't know Morse code.
- Oh, it's very simple. This is A.

5
00:00:15,386 --> 00:00:16,426
[SHELDON KNOCKING ON WALL]

6
00:00:16,595 --> 00:00:17,885
(Sheldon:)This is B.

7
00:00:18,055 --> 00:00:20,305
- This is C.
- I'm not going to learn Morse code...

8
00:00:20,474 --> 00:00:21,724
...at 3:00 in the morning.

9
00:00:21,892 --> 00:00:23,682
(Penny:)All right.

10
00:00:24,603 --> 00:00:27,603
(Leonard:)Don't come in here. Don't come in here.
Don't come in here. Don't...

11
00:00:27,773 --> 00:00:30,023
(Leonard:)Oh.

12
00:00:31,944 --> 00:00:34,864
(Leonard:)- What's going on?
- Shh. Ramona's sleeping on the couch.

13
00:00:35,031 --> 00:00:39,831
- I know. When is she going home?
- Never. That's the problem.

14
00:00:39,994 --> 00:00:42,784
(Sheldon:)- I need your help.
- What are you talking about?

15
00:00:42,955 --> 00:00:46,835
(Sheldon:)I'm invoking the Skynet clause
of our friendship agreement.

16
00:00:47,001 --> 00:00:49,541
(Leonard:)That only applies
if you need me to help you destroy...

17
00:00:49,712 --> 00:00:53,382
(Leonard:)...an artificial intelligence you created
that's taking over the earth.

18
00:00:53,549 --> 00:00:55,889
Come on, don't nitpick.

19
00:00:56,927 --> 00:01:01,027
- Good night.
- All right.

